{"title":"Partition (disambiguation)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Partition</b> can mean:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_(combinatorics)\" title=\"Partition (combinatorics)\">Partition (combinatorics)</a> a way of expressing a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integer</a> as the sum of other positive integers</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_of_an_interval\" title=\"Partition of an interval\">Partition of an interval</a>, a finite subset of an interval; useful in integration.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><i>This is a disambiguation page.  The title you requested could refer to one of the articles listed on this page.</i>\n</p><p>If you were referred to this page through an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Partition_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Partition (disambiguation)\">internal link</a> and you believe that a direct link to a specific article would be more appropriate, feel free to help us out by changing the link on that page.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 436/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.650      1 Template:Disambig\n100.00%    6.650      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6435:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202528 and revision id 23363. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}